== Trivia ==

* The trio's Halloween costumes reference various creatures associated with the holiday. Alsmiffy is dressed as {{Wikipedia|Frankenstein's monster}}, djh3max is what appears to be the {{Wikipedia|wolfman}}, and Trottimus resembles a zombie.{{Verify}}
* The sign with the line "it's dangerous to go alone" is a reference to a {{Wikipedia|It's dangerous to go alone!|line}} in ''{{Wikipedia|The Legend of Zelda (video game)|The Legend of Zelda}}''.

=== Errors ===
*During the fight with the wither, Alsmiffy takes the [[Nether star]] but Trottimus is holding it.

